      "updated_at": "2019-04-06T17:37:22Z",
      "body": "Fixed at 4640614. In `1.0.0.alpha-47` you can get this by:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nmodule.exports = {\r\n  plugins: [\r\n    ['@vuepress/pwa', {\r\n       serviceWorker: true,\r\n       updatePopup: true,\r\n       generateSWConfig: {\r\n         importWorkboxFrom: 'local'\r\n       }\r\n    }],\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
